<title>GERMANY: Bertrandt shares to be priced at 32 to 39 marks.</title>
<headline>Bertrandt shares to be priced at 32 to 39 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank AG said on Monday that shares in  Bertrandt AG would be issued at a price of between 32 marks and 39 marks in an initial public offering.</p>
<p>The final price will be decided on September 28, lead manager Vereinsbank said.</p>
<p>Bertrandt, a German engineering services company, will issue just under one million ordinary shares which will be listed on the Frankfurt stock exchange on October 1.</p>
<p>The new five-mark nominal value shares will be entitled to the full dividend for the 1995/96 year to September 30.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
